{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2022-12-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'STRYKER DECLARES A $0.75 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'KALAMAZOO, MICHIGAN, DEC. 07, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STRYKER (NYSE:SYK) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.75 PER SHARE PAYABLE JANUARY 31, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 30, 2022, REPRESENTING AN INCREASE OF \xa07.9% VERSUS THE PRIOR YEAR AND PREVIOUS QUARTER.'}